                                                "sense_id": "f5feecb9-53e1-3364-aa96-efdb60928ffa",
                                                "text": "Emily, who came up with all the curiosity of the country, would have liked to have seen much more than she did; but young ladies are like the pieces of looking-glass let into chiffonniers and doorways—only meant to reflect the actions of others."
